# gpu-test (gpu-test(8), D173): a user stream, a faulting one and the empty
# job's cost, on a GPU that offers the `csf` capset. An app in the board's
# images, started by `echo start gpu-test >/svc/launcher/ctl`; its lines go
# to the log, and where no GPU offers `csf` it says so and ends.
service gpu-test
program gpu-test
app gpu-test
mount /dev devmgr/dev
